WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Step 2: Connect a wallet

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:07.666
On a phone, wallets open in a bottom sheet. Mobile-friendly options (Scopuly, Albedo, LOBSTR) come first.

3
00:00:07.666 --> 00:00:12.167
Freighter and other extension wallets need a desktop browser. Here we use Albedo, a web wallet.

4
00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:15.968
Albedo asks to share your public key. Approve it in the wallet.

5
00:00:15.968 --> 00:00:20.968
Connected. The app remembers your choice, and every signature is checked against the Testnet passphrase.

